# Tribunal "Helseth's Champion": King Helseth, asked about service to his king,
# wants the player to prove themselves against his bodyguard ("prove yourself",
# "Karrod": 10; "fight my champion": 20, KarrodMovement). Karrod waits at the
# Winged Guar for a day while the player is away, then is back in the Throne
# Room (KarrodFightStart 2). Helseth starts the duel ("fight my champion": 70);
# Karrod at 100 health or less, or dead, is revived, stops and force-greets
# (karrodScript); his greeting, "I am beaten", sets KarrodBeaten 2 and says
# goodbye itself. Helseth, impressed, gives Symmachus's dagger (80), then speaks
# of his plans ("plans for you", "recent events") and sends the player to
# Almalexia ("learn more about the attacks": 100).
# The player sleeps in Ebonheart's Underground Caves while the day passes. The
# damage stands in for the duel: Karrod is essential, so a kill never lands.
# Ref FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's slot 06 and Morrowind.esm's 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr_assassins --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_champion
run
player->PositionCell 2 53 -92 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetDistance player < 400
talk King Hlaalu Helseth
ask service to your king
ask prove yourself
ask Karrod
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Champion == 10
ask fight my champion
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Champion == 20
bye
run
player->PositionCell -210 1800 760 0 "Ebonheart, Underground Caves"
until 300 GetPCCell "Ebonheart, Underground Caves" == 1
rest 48 05554237 KarrodFightStart == 2
run
player->PositionCell 2 53 -92 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetDistance player < 400
talk King Hlaalu Helseth
ask fight my champion
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Champion == 70
bye
until 1200 KarrodFightStart == 3
wait 600
console 065F5724.damageav health 1000
until 600 KarrodBeaten == 2
run
set TestResult to ( "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetPos x )
player->SetPos x TestResult
set TestResult to ( "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetPos y )
set TestResult to ( TestResult + 100 )
player->SetPos y TestResult
until 600 "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetDistance player < 400
talk King Hlaalu Helseth
ask fight my champion
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Champion == 80
ask plans for you
ask recent events
ask learn more about the attacks
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Champion == 100
bye
end
